Configured Claude Code to send telemetry to the Kenaz relay on 127.0.0.1:4318. Restart running sessions to pick it up.
Kenaz memory is on: your AI tool can save notes to $HOME/.kenaz/plugin/memory/memory.db on this device. They stay on this device unless you turn on memory sync (`kenaz memory sync enable`). Turn off: `kenaz memory disable`. Clear: `kenaz memory purge`.
